{"code": "        # BUG_63: off-by-one — should be >= so queue never exceeds max_size and fires the alert when utilization hits 80%
        if len(self.queue) >= self.max_size:
            return False

        self.queue.append(message)
        utilization = (len(self.queue) / self.max_size) * 100.0 if self.max_size else 100.0
        if utilization >= 80.0:
            import orgops.alerts
            orgops.alerts.notify("dlq.capacity.warning", utilization_pct=utilization)
        return True", "comments": "Fixes the off-by-one capacity check and emits the required 80%+ utilization alert inside enqueue."}
